GET http://localhost:8080/test

### Get domains
GET http://localhost:8080/api/domains

### Start interview
POST http://localhost:8080/api/interview/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domain": "JAVA"
}

### Answer question (replace SESSION_ID and your answer)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/interview/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "b90107ab-c99b-41b1-af9c-e31089c180ac",
  "answer": "..."
}